        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There once was a witch who lived in the woods...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She would explore those woods in pursuit of a personal goal.  These woods were mysterious, but that would not stop her from completing her quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She wasn't alone of course.  She had her familiar Merlin, a housecat who slept on the couch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her story is that of exploration and fantasy as she traverses these winter woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633020/extras/walking.gif?t=1763744647\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect materials to craft resources and tools to explore deeper into the woods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A limited day cycle that encourages you to plan how to explore each day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn graphics in a 3D monochromatic world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lovely soundtrack by Dreamware</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can pet the cat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There once was a witch who lived in the woods...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She would explore those woods in pursuit of a personal goal.  These woods were mysterious, but that would not stop her from completing her quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She wasn't alone of course.  She had her familiar Merlin, a housecat who slept on the couch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her story is that of exploration and fantasy as she traverses these winter woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633020/extras/walking.gif?t=1763744647\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect materials to craft resources and tools to explore deeper into the woods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A limited day cycle that encourages you to plan how to explore each day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn graphics in a 3D monochromatic world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lovely soundtrack by Dreamware</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can pet the cat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
